      "position": [
        -112,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 592,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## Automated Invoice Intake & Zoho Books Sync\n\n### How It Works\n* **Email Trigger:** Watches a Gmail inbox for any new message with an attachment.\n* **Parseur Upload:** Sends the invoice PDF to Parseur for extraction, then waits for Parseur's own webhook to fire once parsing is complete, no manual polling delay.\n\n\n### Setup Checklist\n1. **Gmail:** Confirm the Gmail trigger's credentials and that the `has:attachment` filter matches how invoices actually arrive.\n2. **Parseur:** Connect Parseur credentials to both the upload node and the `Parseur Trigger` webhook node, and confirm the `parserId` matches your invoice template.\n3. **Zoho Books:** Verify OAuth2 credentials, and update `organization_id`, `vendor_id`, and `account_id` to match your own Zoho organization.\n4. **Google Drive:** Confirm Drive credentials are connected for both folder lookup and file upload.\n\n### Customization\n* **Vendor mapping:** If you process invoices from multiple vendors, add a lookup step to set `vendor_id` dynamically instead of the hardcoded value.\n* **Folder structure:** Adjust the date format in the folder-naming expression if you'd prefer folders organized by vendor or quarter instead of by month."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c10f7b-271c-451d-8eea-e60bbc98ce27",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        496,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 464,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## 2. Capture & Send to Parseur\n\nWatches the inbox for incoming invoice emails and uploads to PDF straight to Parseur."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1d2a7c28-fb2c-4b09-8ea6-5f52e8787574",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        976,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 656,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## 3. Match & Create Bill in Zoho\n\nFires when Parseur finishes parsing, checks Zoho Books for an existing bill, and creates a new bill only if it's new."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d60ea68c-6b33-441c-98f3-15ecfe732534",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1648,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## 4. Archive to Google Drive\n\nDownloads the original invoice PDF and files it into a dated month folder in Drive, creating the folder on demand if one doesn't already exist for that month."
